meta {
  name: List Trip Days
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trip-days/?trip_id=1&skip=0&limit=100
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  trip_id: 1
  skip: 0
  limit: 100
  ~day_type: sightseeing
  ~start_date: 2025-07-15
  ~end_date: 2025-07-20
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # List Trip Days

  Get all trip days for a specific trip, with optional filters.

  ## Required Query Params
  - `trip_id`: ID of the trip to list days for

  ## Optional Query Params
  - `day_type`: Filter by day type (transit, sightseeing, leisure, etc.)
  - `start_date`: Filter by start date (YYYY-MM-DD)
  - `end_date`: Filter by end date (YYYY-MM-DD)
  - `skip`: Pagination offset (default: 0)
  - `limit`: Pagination limit (default: 100, max: 100)

  ## Response
  Returns simplified list of trip days showing:
  - Basic info (id, date, day_number, day_type, title)
  - Location (place, city, country)
  - Boolean flags (has_activities, has_bookings, has_accommodation)

  ## Notes
  - Days are ordered by day_number
  - Uncomment query params with `~` to use them
}
